ts with citations. GPT Researcher provides a full suite of customization options to create tailor made and domain specific research agents. GPT Researcher goes well beyond RAG: planner and execution agents break each task into research questions, decision models keep only the context that is actually useful for answering them, multi-agent workflows coordinate specialized agents from planning to publication, and recursive deep research explores a topic in both breadth and depth. Research runs in parallel, which keeps it fast,…","Our mission is to empower individuals and organizations with accurate, unbiased, and factual information through AI."],"features":["Objective conclusions for manual research can take weeks, requiring vast resources and time.","LLMs trained on outdated information can hallucinate, becoming irrelevant for current research tasks.","Current LLMs have token limitations, insufficient for generating long research reports.","Limited web sources in existing services lead to misinformation and shallow results.","Selective web sources can introduce bias into research tasks."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/assafelovic/gpt-researcher/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a43c071ae3d19ae35631ae325742b973a8a925ecc3669563c67ed759398ec0e2","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T18:02:46.514Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T18:02:46.514Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T22:03:53Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://www.loom.com/share/6a3385db4e8747a1913dd85a7834846f?sid=a740fd5b-2aa3-457e-8fb7-86976f59f9b8","attemptedAt":"2026-10-12T04:19:35.943Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T04:19:35.943Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-12T04:19:35.943Z","target":"https://www.loom.com/share/6a3385db4e8747a1913dd85a7834846f?sid=a740fd5b-2aa3-457e-8fb7-86976f59f9b8","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-19T04:19:35.943Z","probeVersion":3,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T04:19:35.943Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"GPT Researcher